  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\lim _{x \\rightarrow 2} \\int_{2}^{x} \\frac{3 t^{2}}{(x-2)}$ dt $=\\frac{\\lim _{x \\rightarrow 2} \\int_{2}^{x} 3 t^{2} d t}{\\lim _{x \\rightarrow 2}(x-2)}$\r\n$=\\frac{\\lim _{x \\rightarrow 2} 3 x^{2}}{1} \\quad$ [using L' Hospital's nule]\r\n$=3 \\times(2)^{2}=12$",
